This is a personal security-research project — a toy-scale replication of a public incident for
defensive analysis. The code and documents here are shared for review and research purposes. No
license to reuse, redistribute, or create derivative works is granted without the author's
written permission.

The security samples in `lab/payload/` are benign and provided strictly for defensive and
educational use — memory-forensics practice against known-ground-truth artifacts. They must not
be used against any system without authorization.
